+#: clip of BOTH rigs. 117.000 deg x 32.131 deg, a pure [40:216, 8:632] slice of the
+#: built frames. Raw: `…/incoming/2026-07-28-rig-clean-fix/band_full_3000.json`.
+PHYSICALAI_RIG_CLEAN_176x624 = CanonicalFrame(
