-## Deep-research verdict: rerun as the viz backbone — ADOPTED
-
-Evaluated 2026-07-11 (`rerun-sdk` 0.34.1, pip) in the tanitad venv
-(py3.13/Windows dev box; pure-pip wheel, no system deps, so pods are covered
