-class RefBArm:
-    """REF-B E2E arm (tanitad.refs.refb.RefBModel): tactical waypoints,
-    maneuver distribution, operative action + 0.5 s sequence, confidence
-    prediction and feature-OOD score — all direct heads, nothing to fit.
